  "instructions": "Measured scientific-conference narration in Alloy. Calm, precise, and authoritative. Motivate the first four sentences warmly and conditionally, with no result cadence. Give the auroral-flux to direct-temperature to common-scale evidence chain the strongest emphasis. Do not imply any anchor count, metallicity offset, sign, deficit, evolution, or calibration result has been revealed.",
